---
import "../styles/hero.css";
---

<section class="hero" id="about">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <p class="hero-eyebrow">
      WELCOME TO AI × HEALTHCARE
    </p>

    <h1 class="hero-title">
      從醫療照護問題出發
      <span>讓 AI 成為解決問題的力量</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-description">
      結合醫療照護專業、AI素養、跨域實作與真實場域，
      培養能理解需求、運用科技，並將創新落實於臨床與照護現場的新世代跨域人才。
    </p>

    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="hero-button hero-button-primary" href="/about">
        <span class="hero-button-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <!-- Heart / Healthcare icon -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.6l-1-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8L12 21l8.8-8.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8Z"/>
            <path d="M4.5 12h4l1.5-3 3 6 1.5-3h5"/>
          </svg>
        </span>

        <span>了解計畫</span>

        <span class="hero-button-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>


      <a class="hero-button hero-button-secondary" href="/courses">
        <span class="hero-button-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <!-- Book icon -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M2 5.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 5.5 2H11v17H5.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 2 22V5.5Z"/>
            <path d="M22 5.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 18.5 2H13v17h5.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 22 22V5.5Z"/>
          </svg>
        </span>

        <span>探索課程</span>

        <span class="hero-button-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>


      <a
        class="hero-button hero-button-secondary"
        href="https://lin.ee/REqoALUQ"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        <span class="hero-line-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          LINE
        </span>

        <span>加入LINE</span>

        <span class="hero-button-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-image-wrapper">
    <img
      class="hero-image"
      src="/images/hero-placeholder.png"
      alt="智慧照護創新計劃LOGO"
    />
  </div>
</section>